Ultron-specific enhancements developed and maintained by Subhan Javed include:
- 3D Holographic WebGL/PWA interface, audio-reactive visual particle core, and voice barge-in architecture.
- Global emergency stop mechanism, CancellationToken framework, and authenticated REST execution cancellation.
- Ultron Safety Kernel featuring 4-tier risk classification, PBKDF2 safety passcodes, safe quarantine, and zero-deletion guardrails.
- Desktop application discovery, SystemCatalogRAG, and DesktopOrchestrator integration.
- Real browser automation runtime packaging and standalone desktop bundles.
- Persistent task execution engine with SQLite-backed state machines and DAG skill composition.
- Auditable cloud usage and cost ledger, rate limiting, and resource controls.
- Multilingual speech routing (English, Urdu, Hindi) and ElevenLabs TTS provider integration.
- Pluggable private memory adapters for dedicated Supabase (PostgreSQL with pgvector) and MongoDB instances.
- Additional n8n workflow management, inbound event webhooks, and community skill tools.

